# ---- Sniff 3: working remote, ~1 m. The comments were typed before the sniff
# ---- started; the presses followed in this order: red UP tap, red DOWN held
# ---- ~2 s, then group 1 and UP (the user confirmed afterwards that group 1
# ---- alone sends no RF). No packet appeared when the green window expired
# ---- (the sniff ran ~14 s after the group press).
# working remote, ~1 m
# red UP tap
# red DOWN hold 2s
# group 1 only, wait 10s
ch 33 (2433 MHz)  rate 2m  aw 3  addr(on-air) E7 E7 E7  crc 2  pl 5  filter off (runs)
644.833027 s  ch33  x436   yy yy 01 00 80  ID yyyy  mode 01  group none  no-group state  span 439.3 ms  gap 556-3708 us
651.772263 s  ch33  x1552  yy yy 01 00 80  ID yyyy  mode 01  group none  no-group state  span 1582.6 ms  gap 556-3740 us
673.871815 s  ch33  x436   yy yy 20 01 A1  ID yyyy  mode 20  group 1  UP held  span 253.6 ms  gap 556-660 us
674.126058 s  ch33  x564   yy yy 20 01 21  ID yyyy  mode 20  group 1  UP release  span 331.4 ms  gap 556-660 us
Sniff stopped. 2988 packets.
